WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

The original writing, argument, selection and ordering of material, practice
items, worked explanations, and the site itself, once written. That is the
whole of what is offered here, and it is offered freely.


WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

Two bodies of material stand behind this guide, and neither is the author's
to license:

1. The Anthropic Claude Academy courses and tutorials. Their content is
   Anthropic's. Where a framework, list, or ordering originates with
   Anthropic, the guide says so and names the course. Any residual phrase
   that reads as Anthropic's remains Anthropic's.

2. The official CCDV-F exam guide. The domain names, the domain weights, and
   the inventory of examinable objectives come from that document and are
   Anthropic's. Objective descriptions in this repository are the author's
   paraphrases, written so the guide can discuss the blueprint without
   reproducing it.

Nothing in this licence grants any right in Anthropic's material, and no
reader should treat a CC BY grant here as permission to reuse it. The same
applies to any third-party material read for reference while building this
guide — see SOURCES.md for what was consulted and what, if anything, was
taken from it. Nothing third-party is republished here regardless of its own
licence.


WHAT IS NOT HERE AT ALL

No content from a live CCDV-F examination, in any form: not reproduced, not
paraphrased, not reconstructed. No screen captures of Academy course pages.
Every practice item in this repository, now or added later, is written for
it — never copied or adapted from a third-party source.


NOT AFFILIATED

This is an independent, unofficial guide. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, sponsored by, or reviewed by Anthropic.
